<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap center">
    <h2 class="rise">Drop a clip in. Get a reel out.</h2>
    <p class="lead rise">You do the talking. The app does the part nobody enjoys.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step rise"><b>Drop your clip on the app</b><p>Straight off your iPhone. It gets turned upright and cropped to vertical, and the sound is levelled so you're not too quiet.</p></div>
      <div class="step rise"><b>It cuts and captions</b><p>The pauses come out. Every word gets a caption, timed to your voice. Give it a minute.</p></div>
      <div class="step rise"><b>Fix what you don't like</b><p>Drag things around on the timeline if you want to. Then export the file and upload it yourself.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="strip">
      <figure class="raw rise"><div class="phone"><img src="/assets/raw.jpg" alt="A frame of a raw phone clip: the maker of ReelsEasy talking to the camera" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1273"></div><figcaption>Your clip<span>straight off the phone</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="rise"><div class="phone"><video src="/assets/reel.mp4" poster="/assets/frame-1.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" width="540" height="960" aria-label="The finished reel playing without sound: captions follow the words, emojis pop in, a second clip appears in a corner"></video></div><figcaption>Your reel<span>cut and captioned, playing here</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="rise"><div class="phone"><img src="/assets/frame-3.jpg" alt="The clip with the caption SO I BUILT and a second video of a laptop shown in the top corner" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1280"></div><figcaption>A second clip<span>in a corner or full screen</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="rise"><div class="phone"><img src="/assets/frame-2.jpg" alt="The clip with the caption CLIPS and a scissors emoji beside it" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1280"></div><figcaption>Emojis<span>pop in on the right word</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="rise"><div class="phone"><img src="/assets/frame-5.jpg" alt="The clip with a colour-split effect and the caption SOUND EFFECTS" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1280"></div><figcaption>Effects<span>glitch, colour split, VHS</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="rise"><div class="phone"><img src="/assets/frame-6.jpg" alt="The clip zoomed in, with the caption IT IS FREE and a party emoji" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1280"></div><figcaption>Zooms<span>punch in on the line that matters</span></figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
